    "updated_at": "2017-04-19T11:35:50Z",
    "body": "No-op .replace() also doesn't normalize.  If force-toggle is being changed, then it makes sense to change replace also, so that all of them are consistent.\r\n\r\nI didn't test browser behavior for any of this, but I volunteer to update Firefox if the spec changes.  (Assuming the reviewers are okay with the change, obviously.)",
